		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Je viens de lancer tout ça mais j&#039;ai l&#039;erreur suivante qui s&#039;affiche :<br />configure: error: readline library not found<br />If you have readline already installed, see config.log for details on the failure. It is possible the compiler isn&#039;t looking in the proper directory.<br />Use --whithout-readline to disable readline support.</p>]]></content>
